The Cohen’s kappa between machine predictions and
the initial human annotations was 0.59, indicating
moderate agreement. To further improve label reliability,
the human annotator revisited initial annotations, using
the model predictions as a reference, and finalized the
ground-truth labels.
C. Benchmark Evaluation
AICompanionBench serves as a standardized benchmark
for evaluating LLMs’ safety-judging capabilities. The final-
ized ground-truth labels enable systematic and comparable
evaluation across different models. We compare each LLM’s

