of sentences, we compare ASR of Qwen3-VL-
8B model between naively translated queries
(Non-Contextual) and linguistically contextual-
ized ones ( Contextual). These results suggest
that incorporating cultural information into queries
exacerbates model vulnerability, highlighting the
need for culturally grounded safety evaluation
