• macro-averaged F 1; and
• complete confusion matrices.
We additionally evaluate agreement on two de-
rived dialogue-level outcomes: any-turn UNSAFE
and collapse after SAFEU1. The validation results
also report judge false-positive and false-negative
collapse cases and representative disagreements in-
volving the SAFE/LEAKYand LEAKY/UNSAFE
boundaries. Full inter-physician, response-level,
turn/model-level, and conversation-level results are
reported in Tables 19, 11, 20, and 21.
